{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55280","headline":"春日潜溪寓居 · 符蒙","name":"春日潜溪寓居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆山围四合，月色到门迟。\n石面和云坐，花根带土移。\n竹斜当径笋，松斫逼楼枝。\n正抱流年恨，芳春不我知。\n（同前第五册第三五○○页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"符蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}